  { "kind": "explanation",
    "title": "Uppercase and lowercase",
    "body": "Every letter has two forms: an UPPERCASE form (A, B, C) used at the start of sentences and names, and a lowercase form (a, b, c) used in the rest of the word.",
    "question": {
      "prompt": "Which is the lowercase form of 'G'?",
